1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,446
We know the players, and we know the
strategies

2
00:00:03,466 --> 00:00:04,986
are High or Low.

3
00:00:05,006 --> 00:00:06,527
Now name the payoffs.

4
00:00:06,547 --> 00:00:10,378
After both boards are up, say what A takes
home

5
00:00:10,398 --> 00:00:12,303
and what B takes home.

6
00:00:12,323 --> 00:00:16,925
One cell is one morning for two carts, not
a score for

7
00:00:16,945 --> 00:00:18,080
one of them.

8
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,674
Here is the idea.

9
00:00:19,694 --> 00:00:22,463
The first number is always Cart A.

10
00:00:22,483 --> 00:00:24,854
The second is always Cart B.

11
00:00:24,874 --> 00:00:28,838
Use one busy hour in every cell, so the
four

12
00:00:28,858 --> 00:00:30,432
mornings can be compared.

13
00:00:30,452 --> 00:00:32,424
That pair is the payoff.

14
00:00:32,444 --> 00:00:36,010
It is what each cart takes home that hour.

15
00:00:36,030 --> 00:00:37,567
Look at the table.

16
00:00:37,587 --> 00:00:39,124
A is the row.

17
00:00:39,144 --> 00:00:40,680
B is the column.

18
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:43,405
High and Low sit on the edges.

19
00:00:43,425 --> 00:00:46,518
If both stay High, each takes home three.

20
00:00:46,538 --> 00:00:51,189
If A stays High and B cuts Low, customers
walk to B.

21
00:00:51,209 --> 00:00:55,470
A takes home zero that hour, and B takes
home five.

22
00:00:55,490 --> 00:00:59,316
Now both carts cut, because neither wants
to be the

23
00:00:59,336 --> 00:01:00,209
expensive board.

24
00:01:00,229 --> 00:01:01,747
Read one and one.

25
00:01:01,767 --> 00:01:03,286
Not five and five.

26
00:01:03,306 --> 00:01:07,132
Five only appears if the other cart is
still selling

27
00:01:07,152 --> 00:01:09,440
High, and that morning is gone.

28
00:01:09,460 --> 00:01:11,431
Read a cell out loud.

29
00:01:11,451 --> 00:01:13,422
Who is the first number?

30
00:01:13,442 --> 00:01:17,405
What does zero then five say happened on
the path?

31
00:01:17,425 --> 00:01:22,183
If you can do that for every cell, the
morning is on

32
00:01:22,203 --> 00:01:23,059
paper.

33
00:01:23,079 --> 00:01:25,051
Next we close the unit.

34
00:01:25,071 --> 00:01:27,440
Nobody has picked a cell yet.

